From ed617e26ecf9d6c45e084409ec0a7a61d748c534 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:17:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 22/58] topk: exact restart of the medium path on
 candidate-buffer overflow

When the persistent top-k medium-path candidate buffer overflows, the row is
restarted exactly instead of being truncated. Capture-safe counters with atomic
publication and a coherent snapshot record every restart.
---
